ONly 2  Steps are Required to do this: 
1: First Get the SecurityGroups id
2: Run the query

1: Replace the ami-id by the id of your instance

aws ec2 describe-instances \
  --instance-ids i-0a471cc970ffcd3b5 \
  --query "Reservations[*].Instances[*].SecurityGroups[*].GroupId" \
  --output text

2: The Security Group will be Returened replace that id by the Current one:

  aws ec2 authorize-security-group-ingress \
  --group-id sg-0ffba5d0805a4060e\
  --protocol tcp \
  --port 3306 \
  --cidr 0.0.0.0/0
